@@ -1,5 +1,21 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 1.7.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Each ticket has a due time from its creation and priority. `DUE_TIMES=on` shows `due` and `GET /tickets?overdue=true`.
+- Response-time hours are `DUE_HOURS_URGENT`, `DUE_HOURS_HIGH`, `DUE_HOURS_NORMAL` and `DUE_HOURS_LOW`.
+
+## 1.6.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- `POST /tickets/import` creates up to 5000 tickets in one request, all of them or none.
+
+## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee` assigns an open or in-progress ticket to an agent, or unassigns it.
+- Every ticket has an `assignee` (`null` when unassigned). The assigned agent is notified.
+- `GET /tickets` filters by `assignee`; empty `assignee=` lists unassigned tickets.
+- The command-line listing shows each ticket's assignee.
+
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
 - The operator command line, `bin/tickets.js` (`list`, `show`), and the weekly report, `scripts/weekly-report.js`.
